== 1. a copy that fails midway, then rollback

$ mandrake link apply
  links: backupcopy  rules -> $T/does-not-exist
  Error: copy source $T/does-not-exist
  
  Caused by:
      No such file or directory (os error 2)
  exit 1

$ mandrake link rollback
  rolled back 0 steps
  exit 0

$ ls ~/.claude/rules
  ls: cannot access '$T/home/.claude/rules': No such file or directory

$ find state/backups -type f
  backups/20261025-011106/rules/original.txt

verdict: BUG original.txt is not in ~/.claude/rules; it stays in the backup
